tical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>2</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">C.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">2</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">1</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">+1</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">D.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">2</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">2</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-baqh\">+2</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>The number of correct sets of quantum numbers is __________.</p>",
